---
layout: changelog
title: "A faster Appwrite Console"
date: 2026-11-26
tags: console, performance
---

The Appwrite Console now downloads 27% less JavaScript before it shows the first page, and pages no longer wait for data they don't display. A project page makes 12 fewer API calls when it first loads, and organization settings no longer wait for your project list.

In our tests on a slowed-down connection, project and organization pages showed their content about 20% sooner, and moving between pages in the sidebar was 37% faster. Links also start loading the next page as soon as you hover over them.

It's live on Appwrite Cloud now.
